  "gh:incidentDescription": "中学2年生のYutoが限定商品詐欺に引っかかり、アカウント乗っ取りの被害に遭う。RenとNeiがSIP Project Mapを使って悪意（Ghost）を可視化し、NULL AXEで接続を断ち切る。",
  "gh:industry": "Education / Middle School",
  "gh:mainCharacter": "character:Ren",
  "gh:nistFocus": [
    "PR.AA (Identity Management)",
    "PR.AC (Access Control)",
    "PR.DS (Data Security)"
  ],
  "gh:organization": "org:KounanMiddleSchool",
